      "content": "I hear how exhausted and hopeless you feel when every effort to fix life seems to collapse under the weight of impersonal systems. It makes complete sense that nothing matters when your genuine pain feels ignored by a broken world. Please remember that your struggle is valid and you do deserve support, even if the systems around you feel overwhelming; consider reaching out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline anytime you feel like you are being erased.",
