    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see the point in \"reaching out\" to more systems that are just going to fail me or treat me like a number. if the whole structure is built to crush people like me, why would talking to another part of it help? it's like trying to find water in a desert. i feel like the only way to actually be free of this cycle is to just stop participating in it entirely.",
